# Route: guide 45 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 11 quests, 0.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Winterspring, Felwood): Everlook -> Frostfire Hot Springs -> Everlook
# -> The Hidden Grove -> Mazthoril -> Frostfire Hot Springs -> Emerald
# Sanctuary -> Jaedenar.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): High Chief Winterfall (5121; High
# Chief Winterfall 59); The Final Piece (5123; High Chief Winterfall 59).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

